  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Train and Equip Program - ISAF Deployment Enhancement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this program is to build Croatian forces tactical effectiveness by providing modern, tactical equipment and enhanced communications packages in preparation for their deployment to Afghanistan and participation in Military Assistance Teams (MAT) responsible for training and mentoring Afghan security forces. Equipment provided includes radios, battlespace management equipment, thermal imaging and night vision devices, vehicle marking kits, and heavy machine guns. The recipient unit will be the Croatian Army Training and Doctrine Command, which will be used to train battalions from two armor brigades deploying to support MATs.</narrative>
  </description>
